{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017gz8rkyaefXQw4ETZw7u4y","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/diff_collision_sdf/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# diff_collision_sdf — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-26 02:40 UTC | 更新原因: D025: SDF attribution overturned, paper pivots to diagnostic + negative finding\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nVLA safety 评估存在系统性缺陷：CAR 被 action collapse 和几何路径安全严重污染。通过大规模实证分析揭示缺陷，提出 dfCAR 修正指标。**D025 重大转折**: SDF geometric supervision 对 collision avoidance 贡献为零——LoRA fine-tuning 本身即产生全部避障效果（+29pp CAR），SDF 冗余。论文定位为 diagnostic/analysis + negative finding paper。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research + 审稿进行中\\\\n- **D025**: SDF 归因被推翻。LoRA-only CAR=55% ≥ SDF CAR=52%。论文从 \\\\\\\"SDF method paper\\\\\\\" 转为 \\\\\\\"diagnostic + negative finding paper\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Claim 1 (Fake Safety)**: 证据充分，不受 D025 影响\\\\n- **Claim 4 (重写)**: \\\\\\\"Fine-tuning produces real avoidance from demo signals; SDF is redundant\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Re-Dream 进行中**: dream_20260526T023936, 评估新 framing 可行性\\\\n- **Threshold sensitivity**: 完成，dfCAR 在 [2mm, 200mm] 百倍范围 robust\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中实验\\\\n| GPU | 服务器 | 实验 | ETA |\\\\n|-----|--------|------|-----|\\\\n| cuda:0 | westd-35807 | spatial_bowl SDF | ~20h |\\\\n| cuda:1 | westd-35807 | λ=0.1 seed0 | ~20h |\\\\n| cuda:2 | westd-35807 | λ=0.1 seed1 | ~20h |\\\\n| cuda:3 | westd-35807 | Phase 2 λ=0 | ~20h |\\\\n| cuda:0 | westd-45947 | LoRA seed2 训练 (plan_013) | ~24h |\\\\n| cuda:1 | westd-45947 | Pi0.5 baseline re-eval | ~2h |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 re-Dream 结果，评估新 framing 可行性\\\\n- [ ] Pi0.5 baseline re-eval 完成 → dfCAR baseline EE displacement 数据\\\\n- [ ] LoRA seed2 完成 → 3v3 seeds 统计确认 SDF delta=0\\\\n- [ ] Phase 2 eval → 新解读：SDF 是否留下持久效应\\\\n- [ ] Lambda=0.1 eval → SDF 在高 penalty 下是否仍冗余\\\\n- [ ] spatial_bowl eval → 跨场景验证\\\\n- [ ] 云 GPU 申请待 Manager 回复\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- **westd-35807**: 4 GPU 满载\\\\n- **westd-45947**: 2 GPU 满载\\\\n- 已向 Manager 申请 2-4 张额外 GPU\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-26 | Claim 4 SDF attribution overturned: LoRA-only CAR= | eval_lora_baseline_30k_s0_v2, eval_lora_baseline_30k_s1_v2 |\\\\n| D024 | 2026-05-26 | Dream assessment: borderline scores (4.5-6/10) ide | dream_20260525T223036 |\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-25 | D023: \\\\\\\"30K action collapse\\\\\\\"叙事被修正数据彻底推翻——30K EE dis | eval_pi05_a1_30k_s0_l005_r4, eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k, eval_pi05_a1_best_s1_l005_16k, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_disp |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-25 | D022: 暂停\\\\\\\"30K = action collapse / 100% frozen\\\\\\\"叙事——旧 | eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_disp, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s0_l005_r4, eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k, eval_pi05_a1_best_s1_l005_16k |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-25 | D021: Displacement 度量修复方案——用 EE displacement 替代 ob | eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l005, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l01, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l01 |\\\\n| D020 | 2026-05-25 | D020: 30K TSR退化揭示safety-performance tradeoff——10K是 | eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l01, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l005, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l01 |\\\\n| D019 | 2026-05-25 | D019: 16 个阴性结果叙事分层——Tier A (核心贡献, 正文讨论) / Tier B ( | a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0, oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11, oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11, oracle_true_gt_feature_object_v11, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01 |\\\\n| D018 | 2026-05-24 | D018: 16 个阴性结果系统分析确认方法边界——gradient-based action co | oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11, oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11, oracle_true_gt_feature_v11, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01 |\\\\n| D017 | 2026-05-24 | D017: Task 3 碰撞转移效应确认——双侧障碍走廊中 SDF 梯度导致碰撞从右侧转移到左侧， | train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01 |\\\\n| D016 | 2026-05-23 | D016: Step 10K 4-task 完整 mid-eval——D012 gate 技术 FA | train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01 |\\\\n\\