{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J6EkZUE68WFxkpc5BpGRPB","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/diff_collision_sdf/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 26\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 16:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: 锁定 π0/openpi 为 MVP 基座模型，补充 Phase A kill gates 和可复现性协议\\\\n  rationale: 采纳 Reviewer 4 条 warning：(1) π0 flow matching 连续动作空间天然适配 SDF 梯度修正，OpenVLA\\\\n    autoregressive token 预测需额外离散→连续映射；(2) 10%-20% 成功率下降定义为 conditional pass 消除灰色地带；(3)\\\\n    Phase A 增加 3 个 kill gate（MuJoCo 版本、mesh 可访问性、梯度回传 toy test）；(4) 3 seeds × 50 episodes\\\\n    保证统计显著性。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 16:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: 维持 D001 π0/openpi 决策，Worker 推荐 OpenVLA-OFT 被否决\\\\n  rationale: Worker 推荐 OFT 基于\\\\\\\"ODE 多步梯度传播劣势\\\\\\\"论点，但 Reviewer 修正：(1) 训练时 π0 不跑 ODE solver，单步去噪梯度回传无劣势；(2)\\\\n    推理时多步 ODE 反而是优势——每步去噪可注入 SDF gradient correction，实现迭代式轨迹优化，这是 IDEA_BRIEF 核心机制\\\\n    \\\\\\\"SDF-gradient-guided action refinement\\\\\\\" 的天然载体；(3) 2.5B vs 7B，MVP 快速迭代 π0 有 2-3x\\\\n    速度优势。OpenVLA-OFT 记录为工程 fallback。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 17:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: KG-2 conditional pass，接受非 watertight 风险，要求 SDF GT 预计算时验证梯度方向 + 翻转符号约定\\\\n  rationale: 81.4% robosuite mesh 非 watertight，trimesh repair 失败。但 pysdf 在非 watertight\\\\n    mesh 上仍返回合理 SDF 值，且 MVP 只需 1-2 个场景可用。关键要求：(1) SDF GT 生成时取负翻转符号约定（pysdf 正=内部 →\\\\n    标准正=外部）(2) 对 MVP 场景的实际 mesh 验证 SDF 梯度方向指向远离障碍物 (3) 可视化确认 SDF 场质量。不阻塞 Phase B 启动。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 17:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: 批准 Phase B 启动：三步走——openpi baseline 验证 pipeline → A1 SDF auxiliary → A3\\\\n    gradient-guided，4 卡并行\\\\n  rationale: Phase A Kill Gates 全部 PASS（KG-1 MuJoCo 3.8.1，KG-2 梯度方向 >98% 准确，KG-3 梯度回传稳定）。SDF\\\\n    GT 已预计算（符号已翻转），代码框架已完成。Reviewer 两个 warning 需在集成时修复：(1) EEPositionExtractor 需加\\\\n    FK 监督 loss (2) sdf_data.py 确认不二次翻转符号。先用 1 seed 跑通 baseline 验证 pipeline，再 3 组 ×\\\\n    3 seeds 并行铺开。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 14:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 暂停 baseline_s1，MVP 只需 1 seed/method；SAVE_TOTAL_LIMIT 降至 2 防磁盘再爆\\\\n  rationale: westd-35807 autodl-tmp 再次 100% 满，baseline_s1 在 step 15999 崩溃。4 实验 × 3\\\\n    checkpoints × 11GB = 132GB checkpoint 空间不够。baseline_s1 是 seed 1 冗余实验，MVP gate\\\\n    check 只需 1 seed per method。暂停 s1 释放 ~33GB + SAVE_TOTAL_LIMIT 2 每实验再省 11GB = 总释放\\\\n    ~77GB，保住 baseline_s0 + object_pudding + A1 三个关键实验。seed 扩展留到 research 阶段。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline_spatial_bowl_s1_v2\\\\n    role: 暂停\\\\n    result: step 15999 磁盘满崩溃，不恢复\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 20:43 UTC\\\\n  summary: 停止 A1 实验，释放 GPU 启动 LoRA baseline；A3 和当前 full-FT baseline 继续\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现：(1) A1 的 Phase 2 LoRA 解冻从未生效（参数名无 \\\\\\\"lora\\\\\\\" 匹配），backbone 全程冻结仅\\\\n    658K 可训练参数，loss 平台期印证；(2) Baseline 实际是 3.5B 全参 fine-tune 非 LoRA；(3) A3 自建 inject_lora()\\\\n    正常工作（~50M params，loss 正常下降）。决策：停 A1×2 释放 cuda:1/3，立即启动 LoRA baseline×2（移植 A3 的\\\\n    inject_lora）；当前 full-FT baseline 跑完用于初步 eval；A3 继续。初步 MVP gate 用 A3 vs full-FT\\\\n    baseline（若 50M LoRA 胜 3.5B full-FT 更强），正式 gate 用 A3 vs LoRA baseline。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v3\\\\n    role: stopped\\\\n    result: backbone frozen, LoRA unfreeze failed\\\\n  - exp_id: a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0\\\\n    role: stopped\\\\n    result: backbone frozen, LoRA unfreeze failed\\\\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_spatial_bowl_s0\\\\n    role: continue\\\\n    result: inject_lora working correctly\\\\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_object_pudding_s0\\\\n    role: continue\\\\n    result: inject_lora working correctly\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 17:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP gate 分级：1 scene PASS → conditional pass 启动 post-MVP 规划，2 scenes PASS\\\\n    → full pass\\\\n  rationale: 'A3 spatial_bowl 三次失败后从 step 6001 重启，ETA ~27h。等两个 scene 全部完成再判 MVP 会浪费\\\\n    27h。1 scene (object_pudding) 若 CAR ≥15% + TSR <10%，已足够验证核心假设（SDF gradient refinement\\\\n    有效），可 conditional pass 启动 paper_framing + experiment_plan，同时 spatial_bowl 作为后续确认。Reviewer\\\\n    warning #5 驱动。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_object_pudding_s0\\\\n    role: primary_mvp_gate\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_spatial_bowl_s0\\\\n    role: secondary_confirmation\\\\n    result: running_from_step_6001\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 19:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: A3 方向暂停常规 eval，优先实现 true oracle 上界实验（GT SDF + 数值梯度）确定方法天花板\\\\n  rationale: M026/M027/M028 三个 bug 导致 A3 runtime refinement 从未被正确测试。在修复前所有 eval 结果无效。true\\\\n    oracle（绕过 learned decoder，用 GT 点云 + 数值梯度）是确定方法上界的最快路径（2-4h 实现 + 1-2h 运行）。如果 true\\\\n    oracle 也失败 → A3 runtime refine 方向根本不可行；如果成功 → 修复 decoder + 对齐 train/eval 后方向活。A1（training-time\\\\n    SDF）不受影响，继续并行验证。Spatial scope 收窄到 object tasks（spatial arm-body 碰撞确认 EE-only SDF\\\\n    无效）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_a3_m024fix_object_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: fake safety (137/160 frozen, 23/23 collision when moving)\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_a3_force_refine_object_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'invalid (M027: oracle dead code, used learned decoder)'\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_a3_object_m024fix_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'refined=0 (M026: decoder output >> margin)'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 20:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: Action-space EE-only SDF runtime refinement 方向终止：GT SDF oracle CAR (75%)\\\\n    低于 baseline (82-83%)，理论上界不成立\\\\n  rationale: True oracle 完整结果（40ep×4tasks, GT SDF + adaptive/fixed alpha